  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: (3 × 16) ÷ 8 + 124 ÷ 2 – 64 ÷ (2 × 4) = 84.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) 16 and 64**\n\nGiven: (3 × 16) ÷ 8 + 124 ÷ 2 – 64 ÷ (2 × 4) = 84\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __(3 × 64)__ ÷ 8 + 124 ÷ 2 – 16 ÷ __**(2 × 4)**__ = 84\n\n⇒ __**192**____** ÷ 8**__ + __**124 ÷ 2**__ – __**16 ÷ 8**__ = 84\n\n⇒ __**24**____** + 62**__ – 2 = 84\n\n⇒ **__86 - 2__** = 84\n\n**⇒ 84 = 84**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) 2 and 3\n\nGiven: (3 × 16) ÷ 8 + 124 ÷ 2 – 64 ÷ (2 × 4) = 84\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**(2 × 16)**__ ÷ 8 + 124 ÷ 3 – 64 ÷ __**(3 × 4)**__ = 84\n\n⇒ __**32 ÷ 8**__ + __**124 ÷ 3**__ – __**64 ÷ 8**__ = 84\n\n⇒ __**4 + 41.33**__ – 8 = 84\n\n⇒ __**45.33 – 8**__ = 84\n\n⇒ 37.33 ≠ 84\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 8 and 16\n\nGiven: (3 × 16) ÷ 8 + 124 ÷ 2 – 64 ÷ (2 × 4) = 84\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (3 × 8) ÷ 16 + 124 ÷ 2 – 64 ÷ (2 × 4) = 84\n\n⇒ __**24 ÷ 16**__ + __**124 ÷ 2**__ –** __64 ÷ 8__** = 84\n\n⇒ __**1.5**____** + 62**__ – 8 = 84\n\n⇒ __**63.5**____** – 8**__ = 84\n\n⇒ 55.5 ≠ 84\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 64 and 124\n\nGiven: (3 × 16) ÷ 8 + 124 ÷ 2 – 64 ÷ (2 × 4) = 84\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**(3 × 16)**__ ÷ 8 + 64÷ 2 – 124 ÷ __**(2 × 4)**__ = 84\n\n⇒ __**48 ÷ 8**__ + __**64÷ 2**__ – __**124 ÷ 8 **__= 84\n\n⇒ __**6 + 32**__ – 15.5 = 84\n\n⇒ __**38 – 15.5**__ = 84\n\n⇒ 22.5 ≠ 84\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
